{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/mdksmol.png?t=1743462019\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JUST LIKE IN THE PAPERS.</strong><i><br>MORTALITY DECOMP. KILLERS</i> is a short, fast-paced 3rd person horror/comedy hybrid of games like\u00a0<i>Hotline Miami</i> and <i>Post Void,</i> with hand-drawn visuals inspired loosely by retro detective comics. You'll step into the well-polished shoes of Clive, an undead detective working to take down the criminals that initially killed him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LIVE. DIE. LIVE AGAIN.</strong><br>When a parasite reawakens detective Clive from death, he is recruited into a secret taskforce to stop those that killed him from weaponizing this newfound immortality. Slay crooks and goons in semi-linear corridor levels that are built for honing in and optimising your own quickest path through. Prepare to die, and then die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/extras/StartingPoint.png?t=1743462019\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560730?t=1743462019","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/849ccc56fd5afe18a957bd94e134e5e922bc848e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743462019","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/6c69a4535efbbf54a2df5a65c6ea813ee5211abd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743462019","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560730/6c69a4535efbbf54a2df5a65c6ea813ee5211abd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743462019","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id"